<title>FRANCE: Bouygues to float Offshore unit in Nov.</title>
<headline>Bouygues to float Offshore unit in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>French construction company Bouygues said its unit Bouygues Offshore would be floated on the French and U.S. stock markets in November.</p>
<p>It said the size of the listing and the pricing would hinge on market conditions when the shares were introduced.</p>
<p>Bouygues Offshore specialises in the offshore and onshore oil industry, including industrial maintenance, marine work and transport of liquified gas.</p>
<p>Bouygues Offshore had 1995 turnover of 3.4 billion francs and first half sales this year of 1.8 billion francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
